			"width": 860,
			"height": 140,
			"text": "### adapter/outbound\nLangChain model per role + PromptBook (the agent's prompts, else generic) · Toolbox (MCP, the agent's scope) · A2aPeerAgents (ask_agents) · LangGraph graph generated from TurnPolicy · checkpointer\n[[LangGraph]] · [[Hexagonal architecture]]"
		},
